cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the CatCrypt paper below."
title: "catcrypt-compiler: the CatCrypt verified compiler as a standalone Lean package"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked compiler from a covered fragment of hax-extracted Rust,
  through the Com IR, to a verified owned x86/ARM/RISC-V backend, carved out of
  the CatCrypt workspace with an isolated ISA / jasmin / byte-level trust surface.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CatCrypt Contributors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/spitters/catcrypt-compiler"
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "CatCrypt"
  authors:
    - name: "CatCrypt Contributors"
  year: 2026
  url: "https://eprint.iacr.org/2026/604"
  notes: "Cryptology ePrint Archive, Paper 2026/604"
